/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   JAMBOO QUESTION REPOSITORY — curated seed content
   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   This file is CONTENT, not app code. It is loaded by index.html before the
   builder script (works from file:// and from any static host) and it is the
   single source of truth for quiz material. No LLM ever writes to it.

   Hierarchy:  CATEGORY → SUBJECT → TOPIC → SUBTOPIC → QUESTIONS

   Topics AND subtopics are selectable quiz units: a teacher can build a whole
   topic board (e.g. Coding Languages) or a specific subtopic board (e.g.
   Python, Swift, C#, JavaScript, Minecraft, Taylor Swift & Pop Stars).
   Every subtopic keeps its own question pool.

   Coding Languages keeps Python, Swift, C# and JavaScript at the same pool
   size and mixes concept questions with code-reading ones: predict the output,
   name the operator, find the missing token and debug a broken line.

   Areas:
     School  — Mathematics, Science, Geography, History, Languages
     General — Entertainment, Technology, World

   Choice order is randomised per game by the session builder, so correctAnswer
   may be stored at any index and never leaks into the board.

   Question schema:
     id             stable unique id (never reused)
     subtopic       id of a subtopic declared by the parent topic
     difficulty     1 = easy, 2 = medium, 3 = hard
     question       question text (\n starts a new line for code snippets)
     choices        exactly four unique answer options
     correctAnswer  index (0-3) of the correct choice
     tags           free-form search/curation tags
     language       optional per-question override (defaults to defaultLanguage)
     active         optional; false hides the question from every game
     reviewStatus   optional; only 'approved' (or absent) questions are used
     variantGroup   optional; near-duplicate questions sharing a group are
                    never selected twice in the same game
   ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

